WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,270 --> 00:00:02,270
So many new maps that I haven’t seen before

2
00:00:02,270 --> 00:00:04,270
I don’t know how long the teachers have been doing this

3
00:00:04,270 --> 00:00:06,270
Even if two teams can see the same picture

4
00:00:06,270 --> 00:00:09,270
The timing and level of monsters inside are also completely different.

5
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:11,270
It’s better to play it as usual and be simpler

6
00:00:11,270 --> 00:00:18,650
Not in the doomsday formation

7
00:00:18,650 --> 00:00:19,650
What a pity

8
00:00:19,650 --> 00:00:20,650
Out of the way

9
00:00:20,650 --> 00:00:22,650
It’s also quite interesting to see tankers fighting marine beasts.

10
00:00:22,650 --> 00:00:26,730
Zhang Laila is not a heavy machine firepower person

11
00:00:26,730 --> 00:00:29,730
How can a first-year student have so much money to install firepower accessories?

12
00:00:29,730 --> 00:00:30,730
Watch it

13
00:00:30,730 --> 00:00:32,730
The heavy machine doesn't affect her ability to attack.

14
00:00:32,730 --> 00:00:34,080
That's really amazing

15
00:00:34,080 --> 00:00:42,800
Some seafood flavor at the end

16
00:00:42,800 --> 00:00:43,800
Want to eat fish

17
00:00:43,800 --> 00:00:44,800
My mother recently bought a batch of sea fish

18
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:48,220
Can I bring you some some other day?

19
00:00:48,220 --> 00:00:49,220
I'm fighting monsters now

20
00:00:49,220 --> 00:00:50,220
You can still talk at this time
